WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.769 --> 00:00:12.965
The Carters were driving home from a trip.

2
00:00:12.966 --> 00:00:16.846
Dad was driving.

3
00:00:16.847 --> 00:00:21.068
Suddenly the car made a strange noise.

4
00:00:21.069 --> 00:00:25.234
"Something is wrong with the car," Dad said.

5
00:00:25.235 --> 00:00:33.994
"We need to pull off the road."

6
00:00:33.995 --> 00:00:36.989
Mom looked worried.

7
00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:42.383
"Do we have a flat tire?" she asked.

8
00:00:42.384 --> 00:00:48.198
Dad got out of the car and checked the tires.

9
00:00:48.199 --> 00:00:53.809
"All four tires look okay," he said.

10
00:00:53.810 --> 00:00:57.880
"Is the battery dead?" Aunt Judy asked.

11
00:00:57.881 --> 00:01:02.540
"No, I bought a new battery last week," Dad said.

12
00:01:02.541 --> 00:01:06.443
"There must be something wrong with the engine."

13
00:01:06.444 --> 00:01:11.362
Dad opened the car's hood and looked at the engine.

14
00:01:11.363 --> 00:01:14.312
Mom looked at the engine.

15
00:01:14.313 --> 00:01:17.666
Aunt Judy looked at the engine.

16
00:01:17.667 --> 00:01:20.494
They all looked at each other.

17
00:01:20.495 --> 00:01:23.622
No one knew what to do.

18
00:01:23.623 --> 00:01:27.970
The kids began to complain.

19
00:01:27.971 --> 00:01:32.785
"I'm getting hungry," Harry said.

20
00:01:32.786 --> 00:01:36.997
"I feel thirsty," Emmy said.

21
00:01:36.998 --> 00:01:45.281
"I need to use the bathroom!" Oliver said.

22
00:01:45.282 --> 00:01:50.926
"I see a gas station with a mini-mart," Emmy said.

23
00:01:50.927 --> 00:01:56.477
"It will have food, drinks, and a bathroom," Mom said.

24
00:01:56.478 --> 00:02:00.989
"It will have gas too," Harry said.

25
00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:05.806
"Oh, that's the problem!" Dad said.

26
00:02:05.807 --> 00:02:09.678
Dad slapped his forehead.

27
00:02:09.679 --> 00:02:16.274
"I forgot to fill the gas tank!"
